  (text "THERMABRICK CONTROLLER BOARD (low voltage). Mains wiring stays on the panel per TBK-DWG-003."
    (exclude_from_sim no)
    (at 20.32 25.4 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.5 1.5)
      )
      (justify left bottom)
    )
    (uuid "21efe7e8-bfe5-57e0-9093-2a2f09c5103b")
  )
  (text "SSR DRIVE: GPIO26 high turns Q1 on; J2 feeds the SSR input (+5V to SSR 3, Q1 collector to SSR 4)."
    (exclude_from_sim no)
    (at 20.32 83.82 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.27 1.27)
      )
      (justify left bottom)
    )
    (uuid "999970dc-58dc-59d2-acb5-d153e41d4c92")
  )
  (text "BLOWER DRIVE: GPIO25 PWM on Q2 (logic-level MOSFET); D1 clamps the blower's inductive kick."
    (exclude_from_sim no)
    (at 20.32 127 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.27 1.27)
      )
      (justify left bottom)
    )
    (uuid "35aa57db-f70a-50aa-a075-dcbe8a659ef0")
  )
  (text "1. R1 and R2 hold Q1 and Q2 off while the ESP32 boots or resets (TBK-TST-001, section 1, item 5)."
    (exclude_from_sim no)
    (at 20.32 180.34 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.27 1.27)
      )
      (justify left bottom)
    )
    (uuid "b9427306-43f7-5278-8b89-eea33c6ce766")
  )
  (text "2. U2 is an ESP32-DevKitC V4 (38 pins, rows 25.4 mm apart). 30-pin and narrow clones do not fit."
    (exclude_from_sim no)
    (at 20.32 184.15 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.27 1.27)
      )
      (justify left bottom)
    )
    (uuid "eed95af6-57af-5cc3-8936-508642cbc2cf")
  )
  (text "3. U3 to U7: MAX6675 modules with pins GND VCC SCK CS SO; thermocouples land on the modules."
    (exclude_from_sim no)
    (at 20.32 187.96 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.27 1.27)
      )
      (justify left bottom)
    )
    (uuid "3df488c6-c7e9-5f34-b2bc-56b3569b31e3")
  )
  (text "4. Firmware pins and fault logic: firmware/README.md. Same nets as TBK-DWG-003 low-voltage section."
    (exclude_from_sim no)
    (at 20.32 191.77 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.27 1.27)
      )
      (justify left bottom)
    )
    (uuid "24eaa65b-753f-54b9-bab3-acfa6dae5920")
  )
